# Regenerated by `autoreconf -i`, which every build path runs -- CI, the
# Homebrew formula and the README all invoke it, and they must, because
# `configure` is not tracked either. The -f they pass rewrites these three
# regardless, so a tracked copy only ever surfaces as a dirty tree.
